<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather knowledge of humans from different time periods to learn how to construct the perfect enclosure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique historical humans including Julius Caesar, Cleopatra, and Date Masamune. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor enclosures to appeal to each human’s unique preferences using decor items collected from expeditions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhappy humans won’t remain docile for long. Hire security teams and build defences to deal with rampaging humans before they trash your beautiful park and kill your innocent guests.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's Probing Time!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, Martian explorers have scoured the galaxy for signs of intelligent life. So far, no luck. Nevertheless, there is much to be learned by studying human behavior. Maximize their happiness to enlighten your guests on the mysteries of these strange enclosed-brained creatures, or push your captives to the limit and see what breaks. For science, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760580/extras/15b7e2635dd7eaf5fc6f1c59b64da900.poster.avif?t=1788878754\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760580/extras/15b7e2635dd7eaf5fc6f1c59b64da900.webm?t=1788878754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760580/extras/15b7e2635dd7eaf5fc6f1c59b64da900.mp4?t=1788878754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings and staff abilities from the research tree by performing gruesome experiments on captive humans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dissect excess humans to construct anatomical horrors to decorate your park. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfy your guests’ need for random acts of cruelty by building torture devices, running experiments, or selling merch made from human body parts.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Mars Attracts is a park management sim set in the iconic universe of Mars Attacks™. Play as the devious Martians as you construct detailed enclosures, manage staff, and most importantly - abduct and experiment on humans for the entertainment of your Martian guests!",
